&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: EN-US;&quot;&gt;&amp;bull; Bachelor&#x27;s degree required.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Advanced English proficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
