&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced ERP Finance IT Specialist to support, enhance, and optimize our enterprise financial systems. The ideal candidate will have strong business process knowledge in Finance and Accounting, combined with hands-on ERP implementation and support experience.&lt;/p&gt;
