&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Hands-on experience with Oracle E-Business Suite (EBS) Financial Modules.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Knowledge of end-to-end Procure-to-Pay (P2P) and Order-to-Cash (O2C) processes.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Understanding of system integrations and data flows (EDI/API).&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;
