&lt;p&gt;ERP Senior Manager &amp;ndash; Supply Chain &amp;amp; Logistics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Midea America&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Midea America Corp. is a U.S. subsidiary within Midea Group, the Fortune 500 giant known for making life easier for millions around the globe. As the world&amp;rsquo;s top maker of home appliances, Midea is proud of its 166,000+ employees and presence in 200+ countries, including here in the U.S.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Parsippany, N.J., with an innovation hub in Louisville, Kentucky, Midea America is dedicated to providing practical innovations that surprise and delight, creating moments to cherish at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Midea&#x27;s lineup of appliances - from refrigerators to air conditioners, laundry solutions and floor care - are high quality, reliable, and affordable. By thoughtfully engineering performance, convenience, and design into every product, Midea delivers on the promise of every appliance to make your life a little easier&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sr. IT Supply Chain/Logistics Operation Manager leads IT operations, continuous improvement, and roadmap execution for supply chain and logistics systems, with emphasis on EDI, WMS, TMS, inventory planning, integrations, data-driven performance improvement, and reliable business support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage daily IT operations for supply chain/logistics applications and integrations, including EDI, WMS, TMS, inventory planning, and related systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data, KPIs, dashboards, and automation to improve service quality, reliability, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead root cause analysis for recurring incidents and drive corrective actions to reduce maintenance tickets and production issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to details&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business, vendor, and global IT teams to prioritize enhancements and resolve operational challenges. Lead, coach, and develop a team of 2&amp;ndash;4 IT professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain the supply chain/logistics IT strategic roadmap, balancing stability, scalability, cost, and business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherence to IT controls, change management, security, documentation, and audit requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&amp;rsquo;s degree in IT, Computer Science, Supply Chain, Logistics, Business, Engineering, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in IT operations, application management, systems integration, or supply chain/logistics technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with EDI, WMS, TMS, inventory planning, ERP, order management, or related enterprise systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to use data-driven methods to improve reliability, reduce incidents, and increase process efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in root cause analysis, incident/problem management, continuous improvement, and stakeholder communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing technical teams, vendors, or cross-functional delivery partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SAP, Oracle, Microsoft Dynamics, or similar ERP platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of APIs, middleware, EDI standards, message queues, file-based integrations, and monitoring tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ITIL, Lean/Six Sigma, Agile, PMP, CSCP, CPIM, or related certifications preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success Measures&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduced recurring tickets, incidents, and resolution cycle time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved integration reliability, system uptime, and operational visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear supply chain/logistics IT roadmap aligned to business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder satisfaction and effective team performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Feature Benefits&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Medical, Dental, Vision,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;401K,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive benefit package, to learn more, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;Careers Page (midea.com)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
