&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;1. Circles and Lead Conversion: Lead participation in global data center industry summits, identify and follow up on high-value leads, and drive the implementation of benchmark projects. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;2. Global System Empowerment: Build standardized marketing toolkits to support rapid replication of best practices across overseas regions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;3. Exhibition Display: Transform the value points of building data center products and solutions and combine them with brand communication.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
