&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;mso-ansi-language: EN-US;&quot;&gt;The Senior Key Account Manager will be responsible for managing and developing key accounts within the retail channel, driving business growth, strengthening strategic relationships with customers and ensuring profitability and brand positioning in the market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
