&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Midea Industrial Technology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Midea&amp;rsquo;s Industrial Technologies Business Group is specialized in &amp;lsquo;humanizing&amp;rsquo; our latest technology and providing core component solutions for household appliances, automobile industrial control, and 3C industry with high precision levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This person will spearhead penetrating the U.S. market with an established client base, strengthen relationships with existing clients and expand the perspective client base.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1. Stay current with product launches or transitions to maintain up-to-date sales engagement programs, including both product and service-related support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2. Identify new business opportunities with main OEM manufacturers in the territory, and establish customer rapport with products and services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3. Work with all facets of the customer&amp;rsquo;s organization, including engineering, purchasing/sourcing, operations, product management, and quality representatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4. Provide customer information through presentations covering new products, project schedules, quality performance, and technical training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5. Document market and customer findings and communicate the information back to the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;6. Support sales and marketing efforts to evaluate market segment trends, monitor government regulatory activities, and solicit customer feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7. Supporting team members and peers to achieve KPIs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;8. Support all product and business promotional activities and participate in regional and international trade shows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1. Bachelor&#x27;s Degree in Business, Engineering, or related field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2. 10+ years of experience in Technical Sales and Marketing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3. Knowledge and understanding of HVAC and/or Refrigeration OEM market segments is a must&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4. Technical and commercial understanding of scroll (or competitive technology) compressors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5. Excellent verbal, written, presentation and communication skills (English language).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;6. Highly motivated, self-sufficient, and capable of managing multiple projects&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7. Frequent domestic travel with occasional international travel and weekend travel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;8. Proficiency in Microsoft Suite applications (Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Teams).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
